# The castle defend teleporter (CastleDefendTeleporter): Gludio Castle's first inner gatekeeper,
# talked to by the leader of a clan registered to defend Gludio Castle's siege, answers its page of
# links (onFirstTalk: the clan is on the defender side); its "1" link draws one of the three points
# of index 1 and moves the character there, at no offset (onAdvEvent), answering nothing else.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/castle_defend_teleporter_defender.golden
character Warden 20
clan 5
siege 1 defender
random 1
script script.teleport.CastleDefendTeleporter
page script/teleport/CastleDefendTeleporter/
npc gatekeeper 35092 Folk 10 0 0

action gatekeeper
action gatekeeper
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=gatekeeper item=0 page=script/teleport/CastleDefendTeleporter/first_group_1.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest CastleDefendTeleporter 1
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S TeleportToLocation obj=player loc=-18615,108298,-2556 fast=0
